# PSR-4b-configure-2 — Urban exposure fold (product-named 3→2)

## Scope

| Work | Done |
| --- | --- |
| Inventory product-named configure adapters | Yes (from PSR-4b-configure) |
| Absorb `configure-urban-surface-exposure.ts` into `configure-urban-http-host.ts` | Yes |
| Fix broken `./` relative imports → `../exposure/…` | Yes (latent host-imports-3 defect) |
| Delete standalone Urban surface-exposure configure file | Yes |
| Retarget m17 guard + contract spec + marketing-guard path | Yes |
| Delete denali/urban product HTTP configure entirely | **No** — needs generated bootstrap |
| Generated `workspace-product-http-host-bindings` | Deferred → **PSR-4b-configure-3** |

Land commit: `69a96286`

Machine inventory (shared ratchet file, updated in place):
[`psr-4b-configure-inventory.yaml`](./psr-4b-configure-inventory.yaml)

## Why this slice (not full absorption)

SoT §PSR-4.4 wants product-named configure modules gone. Full deletion of
denali/urban HTTP configure would move branded workspace imports into a
non-allowlisted host file unless the replacement is **generated** (or stays
under `http/configure-*`). Neutrality allowlist still requires branded imports
in `apps/api/src` to live in: `*.generated.ts`, tests, `http/configure-*`, or
the settings allowlist.

Folding Urban exposure into the Urban HTTP configure file:

1. Removes one product-named configure file (**ceiling 3→2**) without violating neutrality.
2. Keeps exposure + HTTP port wiring as one product adapter (single branded surface).
3. Fixes the broken relative imports introduced when the file was relocated from
   `exposure/` → `http/` in host-imports-3 (`./build-field-exposure-engine-input`
   etc. do not exist under `http/` — `tsc` already reported TS2307).

## Classification after this wave

| Path | Class |
| --- | --- |
| `configure-finance-http-host.ts` | `platform-neutral` |
| `configure-workspace-denali-product-http-host.ts` | `product-named` |
| `configure-urban-http-host.ts` | `product-named` (HTTP host **+** Urban exposure resolver) |

## Latent defect closed

| Before | After |
| --- | --- |
| `configure-urban-surface-exposure.ts` imported `./build-field-exposure-engine-input` (missing under `http/`) | Same symbols imported from `../exposure/…` inside `configure-urban-http-host.ts` |

