## Explicit non-goals

- Deleting denali/urban HTTP configure (configure-3 / generated bindings)
- Moving exposure logic into `workspace-urban` package body
- Changing Denali exposure path (`resolve-denali-surface-exposure.ts` stays under `exposure/`)
